+// The retail executable exports __XMemAllocationHooks__: { alloc hook, free hook, ... }. The console D3D12 runtime
+// obtains the memory of a descriptor heap through the alloc hook (allocator id 0x80, object type 4 in the low 14 bits of
+// the attribute word, size = NumDescriptors * increment), and the title answers it with the address it registered just
+// before CreateDescriptorHeap (FUN_141cf3280/FUN_145eb2730 of the 1.0.2.1 executable). The title then asserts that
+// GetCPUDescriptorHandleForHeapStart returns exactly that address. MEASURED on the executable, not documented.
+using TitleAllocHook = void*(__cdecl*)(std::size_t size, std::uint64_t attributes);
