+// ---- XboxCompat diagnostic: LEONIDA_PAUSE_WATCHDOG=1 sets the title's own "watchdog paused" flag (the byte its
+// watchdog thread already honours while it loads). The first run on a slow CPU compiles shaders in the driver for
+// longer than the 30 s the watchdog allows; with this set the compile can finish and land in the pipeline cache.
+DWORD WINAPI watchdog_pauser(LPVOID) {
